<title>THAILAND: Bangkok Bank cuts fixed deposit rates.</title>
<headline>Bangkok Bank cuts fixed deposit rates.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's largest bank, Bangkok Bank Plc said on Monday it had cut its fixed deposit rates by 25 basis points with immediate effect.</p>
<p>After the reduction, the bank's fixed deposit rates will range between 8.50 and 9.75 percent compared with 8.75-10.00 previously, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The interest rate on saving deposits remained unchanged at 5.00 percent, it said.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
